{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-002", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "6/6", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef count_vowel_runs(s: str) -> int:\n    vowels = set(\"aeiou\")\n    count = 0\n    in_run = False\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in vowels:\n            if not in_run:\n                count += 1\n            in_run = True\n        else:\n            in_run = False\n    return count\n```", "tests_passed": 6, "tests_total": 6, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-003", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "5/5", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef merge_slots(slots: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    result: list[list[int]] = []\n    for start, end in sorted(slots, key=lambda s: s[0]):\n        if result and start <= result[-1][1]:\n            result[-1][1] = max(result[-1][1], end)\n        else:\n            result.append([start, end])\n    return result\n```", "tests_passed": 5, "tests_total": 5, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-004", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "5/5", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef tally_votes(votes: list[str]) -> list[str]:\n    counts: dict[str, int] = {}\n    first: dict[str, int] = {}\n    for i, v in enumerate(votes):\n        if v not in counts:\n            counts[v] = 0\n            first[v] = i\n        counts[v] += 1\n    return sorted(counts, key=lambda c: (-counts[c], first[c]))\n```", "tests_passed": 5, "tests_total": 5, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-005", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "5/5", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef stair_ways(n: int, broken: list[int]) -> int:\n    MOD = 1000000007\n    bad = set(broken)\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if i in bad:\n            continue\n        dp[i] = dp[i - 1]\n        if i >= 2:\n            dp[i] += dp[i - 2]\n        dp[i] %= MOD\n    return dp[n]\n```", "tests_passed": 5, "tests_total": 5, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-006", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "5/5", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef rle_decode(s: str) -> str:\n    out = []\n    num = \"\"\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch.isdigit():\n            num += ch\n        else:\n            out.append(ch * (int(num) if num else 1))\n            num = \"\"\n    return \"\".join(out)\n```", "tests_passed": 5, "tests_total": 5, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-007", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "5/5", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef grid_islands(grid: list[str]) -> list[int]:\n    rows = len(grid)\n    seen = [[False] * len(row) for row in grid]\n    sizes = []\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(len(grid[r])):\n            if grid[r][c] == '#' and not seen[r][c]:\n                seen[r][c] = True\n                stack = [(r, c)]\n                size = 0\n                while stack:\n                    y, x = stack.pop()\n                    size += 1\n                    for dy, dx in ((1, 0), (-1, 0), (0, 1), (0, -1)):\n                        ny, nx = y + dy, x + dx\n                        if 0 <= ny < rows and 0 <= nx < len(grid[ny]) and grid[ny][nx] == '#' and not seen[ny][nx]:\n                            seen[ny][nx] = True\n                            stack.append((ny, nx))\n                sizes.append(size)\n    return sorted(sizes, reverse=True)\n```", "tests_passed": 5, "tests_total": 5, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-008", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "5/5", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef next_bus(times: list[str], now: str) -> str:\n    def to_min(t: str) -> int:\n        h, m = t.split(\":\")\n        return int(h) * 60 + int(m)\n    current = to_min(now)\n    ordered = sorted(times, key=to_min)\n    for t in ordered:\n        if to_min(t) >= current:\n            return t\n    return ordered[0]\n```", "tests_passed": 5, "tests_total": 5, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-009", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "6/6", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef bracket_depth(s: str) -> int:\n    pairs = {')': '(', ']': '[', '}': '{'}\n    stack = []\n    depth = 0\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in '([{':\n            stack.append(ch)\n            depth = max(depth, len(stack))\n        elif ch in pairs:\n            if not stack or stack[-1] != pairs[ch]:\n                return -1\n            stack.pop()\n    if stack:\n        return -1\n    return depth\n```", "tests_passed": 6, "tests_total": 6, "note": null}
{"run_id": "haiku55-low-bcb885f0", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5-low", "question_id": "code-010", "category": "code", "method": "code_tests", "choice_index": 0, "extracted": "6/6", "status": "correct", "content": "```python\ndef split_bill(total: int, weights: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    W = sum(weights)\n    shares = [total * w // W for w in weights]\n    rem = total - sum(shares)\n    order = sorted(range(len(weights)), key=lambda i: (-((total * weights[i]) % W), i))\n    for i in order[:rem]:\n        shares[i] += 1\n    return shares\n```", "tests_passed": 6, "tests_total": 6, "note": null}
